in the history of the sport.

00:00:46.125 --> 00:00:47.875
- That's a f--kin' lie.

00:00:47.875 --> 00:00:49.583
Let me tell you why.
- Tell me why.

00:00:49.583 --> 00:00:51.625
- He's not the better
f--kin' receiver.

